# and week09/ below is also committed on the `team_02` branch of the studio repo
# (github.com/sclebow/AIA26_Studio), so it is recoverable from there. The
# marketing build frames, the silent video cut and docs/thesis/ exist only here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

